NOTE = "Version 1.3.0 repairs connectedness (discipline version 2.18.0 BP-D56 and version 2.19.0 BP-D57): every subject branch of the chapter is now linked to the others by the relations the chapter's own definitions state, chx:hasOwner has the domain and range its use shows, and chx:input and chx:output are declared. No class was added, removed or renamed, so MINOR."
# (id, label, domain, range, why)  why = the claim and the chapter text that states it
